The defect: the bound off by one in `reply_errno`, `r0 > -MAXIMUM_ERRNO`, so the last code the
sender may send decodes as `EPROTO`.

Expected to fail: `assert_eq!(reply_errno(word), Some(code))`, at `code == MAXIMUM_ERRNO`.

